WEBVTT

00:40.960 --> 00:42.520
Are you in charge of the funeral parlor?

00:43.200 --> 00:44.080
Not really.

00:45.440 --> 00:47.000
I'm just an embalmer.

00:47.640 --> 00:48.560
Tell me then.

00:49.200 --> 00:51.120
How much would you charge
to cremate one leg?

00:53.200 --> 00:54.520
That is

00:55.520 --> 00:56.520
a unique question.

00:58.080 --> 00:59.560
You haven't been around much then.

01:00.360 --> 01:02.080
I don't pride myself on such things.

01:02.160 --> 01:04.800
But if you want
to hear a practical answer,

01:05.560 --> 01:06.840
you should be sincere as well.

01:08.000 --> 01:10.000
At least tell me
some specific information.

01:11.800 --> 01:13.480
I avoided the funeral parlor in this area

01:14.600 --> 01:16.280
because I didn't want my family to know.

01:16.920 --> 01:17.840
It would be troublesome.

01:17.920 --> 01:19.640
So don't ask me so many questions.

01:19.720 --> 01:20.680
Just tell me.

01:20.760 --> 01:22.640
Does it cost more to cremate one leg

01:22.720 --> 01:24.160
or an entire body?

01:24.240 --> 01:25.280
I'll compare the prices.

01:31.040 --> 01:31.960
Sorry,

01:33.000 --> 01:35.000
but are you going
to undergo an amputation?

01:35.760 --> 01:37.440
Yes. Bone cancer.

01:37.520 --> 01:38.640
I either cut it off or die.

01:41.040 --> 01:42.440
Your mental state seems stable.

01:42.520 --> 01:43.400
Everyone says so.

01:44.480 --> 01:47.120
They say I'm still young
and well financially.

01:48.680 --> 01:50.120
As long as I can stay alive,

01:50.200 --> 01:51.880
losing a leg won't impact me too much.

01:53.760 --> 01:54.760
They're not right.

01:55.440 --> 01:56.840
It will definitely impact you.

01:57.760 --> 01:59.720
I know a young lady who had an amputation.

02:00.840 --> 02:01.960
It took her a few years

02:02.560 --> 02:03.960
to get her life back on track.

02:06.360 --> 02:08.080
Even so, she's doing very well now.

02:08.560 --> 02:10.800
She has a successful career
and is lively and energetic.

02:12.240 --> 02:14.640
Losing a leg hasn't affected
her optimism or pleasant nature.

02:15.560 --> 02:17.960
That has nothing to do with me.

02:19.320 --> 02:20.760
Just tell me the price.

02:21.720 --> 02:23.920
You've been talking
about money since just now.

02:24.640 --> 02:26.640
Maybe money is very important to you,

02:26.720 --> 02:28.480
but forgive me for being frank.

02:29.840 --> 02:31.960
I don't think
money can determine someone's value.

02:32.680 --> 02:34.320
I'm already at this stage of my life.

02:35.280 --> 02:37.120
There's no point
in saying those empty words.

02:37.880 --> 02:38.960
I know it all too well.

02:39.040 --> 02:40.440
There's no point in asking you.

02:40.520 --> 02:42.040
I've thought it through.

02:42.720 --> 02:44.520
If all else fails,
I'll find an empty bridge

02:44.600 --> 02:46.640
and jump off it to end everything.

02:47.360 --> 02:48.920
I will no longer cause anyone trouble.

02:50.360 --> 02:51.440
You're wrong again.

02:55.240 --> 02:57.200
If you really want to jump off a bridge,

02:58.720 --> 03:01.080
you would be causing trouble
for public service workers.

03:01.160 --> 03:03.080
The bridge you choose is also important.

03:03.160 --> 03:05.040
Take my hometown's Nanping Bridge
as an example.

03:05.640 --> 03:07.400
If a body is washed upstream,

03:07.480 --> 03:09.160
Ningfu Town would have to deal with it.

03:09.680 --> 03:11.160
If it is washed downstream,

03:11.240 --> 03:13.400
Ji'an Town would need to deal with it.

03:13.480 --> 03:15.000
If it happens to be midstream,

03:15.080 --> 03:17.560
both towns would have to meet
and argue about it.

03:17.640 --> 03:19.120
That would be very troublesome.

03:23.440 --> 03:24.720
You're pretty amusing.

03:26.360 --> 03:28.000
Very few people say that about me.

03:30.040 --> 03:31.640
I know you're having a tough time.

03:33.520 --> 03:35.080
I can't say I understand how you feel.

03:37.400 --> 03:38.440
But I want to tell you

03:40.240 --> 03:42.320
that everyone has times
when they're tired of life.

03:42.400 --> 03:43.440
The reasons may vary,

03:44.760 --> 03:46.360
but the pain is the same.

03:48.560 --> 03:49.680
Including you?

03:50.280 --> 03:51.160
Including me.

03:52.440 --> 03:53.280
You're kidding me.

03:55.960 --> 03:57.640
You look perfectly fine.

03:59.080 --> 04:00.080
In the face of death,

04:02.280 --> 04:03.280
everyone is the same.

04:04.160 --> 04:05.440
Some family members

04:05.520 --> 04:08.720
want to use special coffins, unique urns,

04:09.320 --> 04:10.320
or expensive headstones

04:10.400 --> 04:11.880
to prove the deceased was special.

04:12.800 --> 04:14.440
However, these are all just illusions.

04:16.640 --> 04:17.680
When it comes to death,

04:19.279 --> 04:21.160
everyone is the same.

04:22.000 --> 04:23.600
We can only prove how special we are

04:24.640 --> 04:26.120
by living well.

04:28.520 --> 04:29.880
Just like the disabled lady

04:32.800 --> 04:34.200
that I mentioned.

04:43.560 --> 04:45.360
Do you like this lady?

06:07.720 --> 06:12.560
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

06:15.640 --> 06:17.200
In the next decade, import substitution

06:17.280 --> 06:19.480
will be the priority
of China's medical device industry.

06:19.560 --> 06:21.560
Currently, the problem we face
is the lack of synergy

06:21.640 --> 06:23.760
between the upstream and downstream
of our supply chain.

06:25.480 --> 06:28.000
So we need to come together
to build a single team

06:28.080 --> 06:30.080
of medicine, supplies,
and engineering services

06:30.160 --> 06:31.720
that can complement each other.

06:32.520 --> 06:33.960
All right, take a rest.

06:34.040 --> 06:36.240
I've been listening to that
for the past two days.

06:38.440 --> 06:39.480
What are you doing?

06:39.560 --> 06:41.840
Has the United Nations
invited you to deliver a speech?

06:41.920 --> 06:44.520
To me, this opportunity is as important
as a United Nations speech.

06:45.440 --> 06:46.880
Do you remember when I mentioned

06:46.960 --> 06:48.360
my former boss, Ms. Huang?

06:48.880 --> 06:51.480
She's interested in the business plan
that Wang Xixia and I created.

06:51.560 --> 06:54.280
She will invest a lot of money
to help us take off.

06:54.760 --> 06:56.600
Have you discussed this with Maidong?

07:00.320 --> 07:02.800
We can't talk about this over the phone.

07:03.720 --> 07:06.120
When he returns and his mood is better,

07:06.800 --> 07:08.400
I'll tell him everything honestly.

07:17.240 --> 07:18.520
Why are you staring at me?

07:20.480 --> 07:22.320
A mother knows her daughter.

07:22.400 --> 07:23.600
Tell him honestly?

07:23.680 --> 07:25.160
Do you want to keep this from him?

07:25.240 --> 07:26.720
How can I hide this from him?

07:26.800 --> 07:28.280
But I have to find a way

07:28.360 --> 07:29.840
to talk to him about this.

07:30.520 --> 07:32.040
Who was the one bragging to me?

07:32.120 --> 07:34.840
If we like each other,
we should be together and enjoy dating.

07:34.920 --> 07:36.400
I'll still return to Shanghai after--

07:36.480 --> 07:38.120
All right! I know I did say that.

07:38.200 --> 07:39.680
But can you stop teasing me?

07:39.760 --> 07:40.640
Did I do that?

07:41.480 --> 07:42.320
Seriously.

07:42.400 --> 07:44.240
I'm thrilled to see
both of you getting serious

07:44.320 --> 07:45.560
in your relationship.

07:47.000 --> 07:48.680
The more serious it is,
the more difficult it gets.

07:49.480 --> 07:50.760
We're in our honeymoon phase

07:50.840 --> 07:52.080
and we have to be long-distance.

07:53.280 --> 07:55.200
I think he might not
be willing to do that.

07:55.280 --> 07:56.920
Is it just up to him?

07:57.000 --> 07:58.880
Is he going to break up with me?

07:58.960 --> 08:00.560
The two of you aren't married yet.

08:00.640 --> 08:02.360
You can't force him.

08:03.160 --> 08:04.240
I won't let him go.

08:05.080 --> 08:07.160
At worst, I'll find some allies

08:07.240 --> 08:08.160
to help me secretly.

08:09.320 --> 08:10.360
Good luck.

08:14.120 --> 08:16.640
The last time that Maidong had pink eye

08:16.720 --> 08:19.000
was when his parents divorced.

08:19.080 --> 08:20.560
He didn't tell me about that.

08:20.640 --> 08:21.840
Just pretend you don't know.

08:22.640 --> 08:24.640
He must have cried a lot recently.

08:25.560 --> 08:27.640
We're here to see flowers.
Let's not talk about this.

08:28.240 --> 08:29.880
Have you read this poem?

08:30.880 --> 08:33.280
"Pick the flowers while they are blooming

08:33.360 --> 08:35.520
Soon nothing will be left
Save bare boughs and tears"

08:36.600 --> 08:38.440
You don't get to witness spring

08:38.520 --> 08:40.360
in our town every year.

08:41.400 --> 08:44.080
Take a look and treasure it.

08:45.720 --> 08:46.880
Mrs. Chen,

08:46.960 --> 08:49.440
I know what you're trying to say.

08:51.000 --> 08:52.640
You're so smart.

08:52.720 --> 08:54.040
I won't say more.

08:54.600 --> 08:56.280
Otherwise,

08:56.360 --> 08:58.280
you youngsters get fed up with it.

08:58.360 --> 08:59.800
What do you mean?

08:59.880 --> 09:01.120
You're so smart and adorable.

09:01.200 --> 09:02.520
How could I get fed up with you?

09:02.600 --> 09:04.000
If not for you,

09:04.080 --> 09:06.400
Chen Maidong and I
wouldn't even be together.

09:07.680 --> 09:08.720
But Mrs. Chen,

09:08.800 --> 09:10.000
I also want you

09:10.080 --> 09:11.760
to understand the situation I'm in.

09:12.320 --> 09:14.680
I can't give up on my life in Shanghai.

09:15.200 --> 09:18.640
I have a career and friends there.

09:20.040 --> 09:21.040
Of course.

09:21.840 --> 09:23.040
Times have changed.

09:23.720 --> 09:25.480
It's understandable for women

09:25.560 --> 09:26.560
to build a career.

09:26.640 --> 09:28.440
I knew you were the most understanding.

09:28.920 --> 09:31.240
Thank you so much for saying that.

09:31.320 --> 09:33.240
But Mrs. Chen, don't worry.

09:33.320 --> 09:35.240
I will be good to Chen Maidong.

09:36.360 --> 09:39.520
Although I haven't thought
of a perfect plan,

09:40.160 --> 09:42.640
I believe that I will.

09:43.400 --> 09:44.360
I believe you.

09:45.160 --> 09:48.480
But you have to tell me the truth.

09:49.840 --> 09:53.080
Are you and Maidong just dating casually

09:54.520 --> 09:56.320
or have you considered marriage?

09:58.560 --> 10:01.120
Previously, I didn't
put much thought into it.

10:01.200 --> 10:03.680
I felt that if we like each other,
we should be together.

10:03.760 --> 10:05.520
We can be friends even if we break up.

10:07.520 --> 10:08.480
But Mrs. Chen,

10:09.720 --> 10:11.240
I'm now very sure

10:12.240 --> 10:15.200
that I need him to be in my life.

10:17.320 --> 10:18.800
I'm very thankful

10:19.440 --> 10:21.200
to hear you say that.

10:27.280 --> 10:29.000
Well, Jie,

10:29.080 --> 10:31.480
I want to tell you this
from the bottom of my heart.

10:32.880 --> 10:35.680
I think once you meet the right person,

10:36.200 --> 10:37.360
you should get married.

10:37.920 --> 10:39.560
I'm not old-fashioned

10:39.640 --> 10:41.880
and I'm not urging you to have children.

10:43.120 --> 10:44.120
I just think

10:44.720 --> 10:46.320
if a man and a woman

10:46.400 --> 10:48.200
just want to have fun,

10:48.280 --> 10:50.080
they may hang out or move in together.

10:50.160 --> 10:51.080
It does make things easier.

10:51.160 --> 10:53.640
When they split up,
it saves a lot of trouble.

10:54.400 --> 10:58.000
But such a relationship
that leaves no trace

10:58.840 --> 10:59.880
won't help one to grow.

11:02.360 --> 11:05.040
Although maintaining a marriage

11:05.120 --> 11:06.440
or having a divorce

11:06.520 --> 11:07.600
comes with a huge price

11:08.200 --> 11:10.160
and will even leave behind

11:10.240 --> 11:11.840
some unhappy experiences,

11:13.080 --> 11:15.280
this in itself is meaningful.

11:15.920 --> 11:17.360
In one's life,

11:18.520 --> 11:20.680
one should earnestly get hurt

11:20.760 --> 11:22.480
and suffer losses.

11:22.560 --> 11:24.520
That way, you get
to live a fulfilling life.

11:25.080 --> 11:27.040
When I was young,

11:27.120 --> 11:29.560
I often got into conflicts with others

11:29.640 --> 11:31.680
because of my poor temperament.

11:31.760 --> 11:34.040
In the past,
I hoped I could forget it all.

11:35.560 --> 11:37.320
But after Ms. Lin's passing,

11:37.400 --> 11:39.400
I've been living vicariously
through memories.

11:41.040 --> 11:42.120
Not only do I miss her,

11:44.040 --> 11:46.440
but I also think of all the friends

11:47.520 --> 11:49.520
who have hurt me or been hurt by me.

11:51.320 --> 11:52.280
Jie,

11:53.080 --> 11:57.560
life is full of ups and downs.

12:02.800 --> 12:03.960
Mrs. Chen,

12:04.840 --> 12:05.800
you're the best.

12:05.880 --> 12:08.120
I knew you would be my ally.

12:08.200 --> 12:09.880
No matter when,

12:09.960 --> 12:12.200
girls help girls.

12:12.280 --> 12:13.800
Girl…

12:13.880 --> 12:15.720
What? Girl what?

12:15.800 --> 12:17.920
"Girls" means us.

12:18.840 --> 12:19.960
"Girls."

12:20.040 --> 12:20.960
Great.

12:21.840 --> 12:23.280
Girls are great!

12:25.040 --> 12:25.920
Yes!

12:26.520 --> 12:27.480
Great!

12:27.560 --> 12:28.680
Good.

13:39.480 --> 13:40.960
Didn't I tell you so?

13:41.560 --> 13:43.000
Nothing is good or bad.

13:43.080 --> 13:45.120
But everything should be in moderation.

13:45.200 --> 13:46.240
Looking at your tongue,

13:46.320 --> 13:49.280
your liver and stomach are quite balanced.

13:50.080 --> 13:52.440
Drink less high-proof alcohol
and you will be fine.

13:52.520 --> 13:54.360
Stick out your tongue.
Let me take another look.

13:58.000 --> 13:58.840
Mom.

13:59.560 --> 14:01.280
Why are you getting a consultation?

14:01.960 --> 14:03.160
Dr. Cui's fee is very high.

14:03.240 --> 14:04.440
No. What are you saying?

14:04.520 --> 14:05.640
I came to Nanping

14:05.720 --> 14:07.680
to volunteer at a free clinic anyway.

14:08.640 --> 14:10.600
He has been waiting all morning for you!

14:12.960 --> 14:14.040
If I didn't do this,

14:14.120 --> 14:15.520
I wouldn't know what to say to him.

14:16.400 --> 14:18.000
Dr. Cui, go inside to chat.

14:18.080 --> 14:19.440
I'll cut some fruit for you.

14:19.520 --> 14:21.680
-Thank you.
-Not at all. Please go inside.

14:24.400 --> 14:26.280
-Please, sit.
-Thank you.

14:27.880 --> 14:29.720
-Thank you.
-Not at all.

14:38.600 --> 14:40.480
Cui Ge, you came all of a sudden,

14:40.560 --> 14:42.240
and Xixia didn't even tell me.

14:42.320 --> 14:43.400
I didn't tell Xixia.

14:44.200 --> 14:45.480
Is this not a good time?

14:45.560 --> 14:46.480
Not at all.

14:46.560 --> 14:47.560
That's not what I mean.

14:48.160 --> 14:49.040
Don't worry.

14:49.120 --> 14:51.360
Your mother is very healthy.

14:51.440 --> 14:53.400
If I didn't give her a checkup,

14:53.480 --> 14:54.880
we would have nothing to talk about.

14:57.680 --> 15:00.120
Well, Cui Ge, is there something you need?

15:17.600 --> 15:19.920
XI

15:22.280 --> 15:23.240
Wait.

15:24.880 --> 15:26.880
Do you want me
to help you with a proposal?

15:28.440 --> 15:30.120
I want you to take a look at this

15:30.200 --> 15:32.600
and tell me if Xixia will like it.

15:36.200 --> 15:38.320
XI

15:40.640 --> 15:41.520
"Xi."

15:44.760 --> 15:45.720
Well, I…

15:46.360 --> 15:48.560
I dare not make such a decision
on her behalf.

15:49.120 --> 15:50.360
If it's clothes or shoes,

15:50.440 --> 15:51.840
I might be able to help.

15:51.920 --> 15:54.360
But for a ring, you should ask her.

15:55.360 --> 15:58.400
Actually, I've asked her indirectly
about her preferences

15:58.480 --> 15:59.880
before I got this.

16:03.440 --> 16:04.400
Then…

16:04.480 --> 16:05.360
That's great.

16:05.440 --> 16:07.200
Then you don't have to check with me.

16:08.560 --> 16:09.960
But I'm not sure

16:10.800 --> 16:12.080
if she wants to get married.

16:14.200 --> 16:16.160
Xixia probably began fantasizing
about her wedding

16:16.240 --> 16:18.040
when she was six.

16:18.640 --> 16:20.320
Talking about it is one thing,

16:20.400 --> 16:22.200
but actually getting married is another.

16:23.520 --> 16:25.000
I've been wondering

16:25.080 --> 16:27.640
why independent women like the two of you

16:27.720 --> 16:29.360
would need to get married.

16:30.200 --> 16:33.240
Men take up space and are troublesome.

16:33.800 --> 16:34.840
Besides,

16:34.920 --> 16:36.560
this would be my second marriage.

16:37.120 --> 16:39.240
What makes me indispensable?

16:39.760 --> 16:41.240
What can I give her?

16:42.640 --> 16:45.640
Cui Ge, not many men share your thoughts.

16:46.800 --> 16:49.640
Precisely because Xixia and I
are modern women,

16:49.720 --> 16:51.320
we are used to being misunderstood.

16:51.400 --> 16:53.400
In fact, we aren't against marriage

16:53.480 --> 16:56.360
or think that a DINK lifestyle
is necessary.

16:56.440 --> 16:58.920
The key is meeting the right person
at the right time.

16:59.640 --> 17:01.480
Since we have already turned 30,

17:01.560 --> 17:03.520
we should live the lives we want

17:03.600 --> 17:05.440
and be responsible for our decisions.

17:06.079 --> 17:09.599
So don't worry
about marriage or kids for us.

17:13.119 --> 17:14.000
I understand.

17:14.800 --> 17:15.920
Thank you.

17:17.280 --> 17:18.240
Zhuang Jie,

17:18.319 --> 17:19.480
don't worry.

17:19.560 --> 17:21.160
I'll treat Xixia well.

17:21.240 --> 17:22.319
I know.

17:42.840 --> 17:45.080
I MISS YOU

17:48.440 --> 17:49.280
Are you crazy?

17:50.720 --> 17:52.600
I was napping and didn't check my phone.

17:53.560 --> 17:54.720
I miss you too.

17:56.320 --> 17:57.280
See you tomorrow.

19:27.720 --> 19:29.240
Are your eyes feeling better?

19:29.320 --> 19:30.200
Much better.

19:31.080 --> 19:32.280
That's dirty.

19:32.920 --> 19:35.120
I went to the pharmacy
to get you some eye drops.

19:35.200 --> 19:36.680
Just to be safe.

19:36.760 --> 19:38.720
No need. I'll do it myself tonight.

19:38.800 --> 19:40.000
I'll do it for you.

19:43.000 --> 19:44.320
Let's head back first.

19:44.400 --> 19:45.320
Open your eyes.

19:46.040 --> 19:47.360
Come on.

19:47.920 --> 19:50.120
Stay still. We'll do this quickly.

20:13.760 --> 20:14.880
You lost so much weight.

20:16.880 --> 20:18.440
I should have been by your side.

20:19.280 --> 20:20.160
It's fine.

20:21.720 --> 20:23.840
You didn't come
straight to see me after coming back.

20:24.400 --> 20:25.560
Didn't you miss me?

21:06.160 --> 21:07.000
Get on.

21:07.840 --> 21:08.760
I'll buy you breakfast.

21:08.840 --> 21:09.680
Okay.

21:11.760 --> 21:13.080
Come to the apartment tonight?

21:13.160 --> 21:14.120
Okay.

21:43.480 --> 21:44.320
Cui Ge.

21:48.040 --> 21:50.000
I want to ask you something too.

21:52.360 --> 21:54.400
Would you accept
a long-distance relationship?

21:56.720 --> 21:57.560
Honestly?

21:57.640 --> 21:58.760
Of course.

22:00.520 --> 22:02.040
If we were married,

22:02.120 --> 22:04.400
then there would be no choice
but to overcome it.

22:04.480 --> 22:06.960
But if I still had a choice,

22:07.840 --> 22:08.920
I wouldn't want to.

22:11.160 --> 22:12.200
Why?

22:13.040 --> 22:13.880
Because

22:14.360 --> 22:16.520
I'm no longer a young lad.

22:16.600 --> 22:20.360
I'm very aware that time and distance
will surely take a toll on a relationship.

22:20.920 --> 22:22.320
I wouldn't want to take the risk.

22:24.440 --> 22:25.680
Let's be realistic.

22:26.280 --> 22:28.240
What I need is someone who eats with me

22:28.320 --> 22:29.920
and sleeps by my side

22:30.560 --> 22:31.800
rather than communicating

22:31.880 --> 22:33.360
through chat or phone calls.

22:34.520 --> 22:37.040
Anyway, to a mature man,

22:37.120 --> 22:38.440
it doesn't mean much.

22:46.640 --> 22:47.480
Today,

22:48.120 --> 22:49.520
Health and Healing Channel

22:49.600 --> 22:51.320
will narrate a prose

22:51.400 --> 22:53.480
written by Mr. Wang Zengqi.

22:55.040 --> 22:56.920
When people mention him,

22:57.000 --> 22:57.840
they always call him

22:57.920 --> 23:00.560
China's last pure literary scholar.

23:01.440 --> 23:03.160
He once came up with a famous quote.

23:04.600 --> 23:05.840
It goes,

23:05.920 --> 23:09.400
"Love is non-professional.

23:09.480 --> 23:11.880
It has nothing to do
with one's talent or capability.

23:13.880 --> 23:15.520
It grows like flowers and trees,

23:15.600 --> 23:16.920
like our love and attachment

23:17.000 --> 23:19.360
to time and seasons."

23:21.440 --> 23:22.280
So,

23:23.440 --> 23:25.720
when we find frustrations

23:26.240 --> 23:27.760
and contradictions in life…

23:27.840 --> 23:29.440
Contradictory.

23:30.200 --> 23:33.520
"Among the people of Chu,
a man sold shields and lances.

23:34.240 --> 23:35.320
He praised them and said,

23:36.200 --> 23:38.280
'My shields are so firm,

23:38.360 --> 23:40.600
there is nothing that can pierce them.'

23:41.800 --> 23:43.880
He also said…"

23:45.080 --> 23:46.640
If you keep playing with your toes,

23:46.720 --> 23:48.360
someone will come to beat you up.

23:48.440 --> 23:51.320
You still haven't memorized a single word.

23:51.400 --> 23:52.480
What if Yan tests you?

23:52.560 --> 23:54.240
Jie, just worry about yourself.

23:54.320 --> 23:55.440
Leave me be.

23:56.040 --> 23:57.480
Listening to this makes me depressed.

23:57.560 --> 23:58.760
Are you depressed?

23:58.840 --> 24:00.000
We're more depressed than you.

24:00.080 --> 24:01.560
Do you want to repeat a year?

24:02.560 --> 24:06.080
To me, this fable is a piece of cake.

24:06.160 --> 24:08.000
Keep on bragging. Recite one for me.

24:08.880 --> 24:10.320
Why should I?

24:10.400 --> 24:12.680
One word sums it up. "Contradictory."

24:13.600 --> 24:15.000
Forget about the people of Chu.

24:15.600 --> 24:16.800
Just look at you.

24:17.960 --> 24:19.640
In what way am I contradictory?

24:19.720 --> 24:21.240
Last night, you were on the phone

24:21.320 --> 24:23.240
with someone in Shanghai for two hours.

24:23.320 --> 24:25.800
Then you had a video call
with Xixia for half an hour.

24:25.880 --> 24:29.200
You said,
"I don't know how to tell Maidong."

24:30.360 --> 24:31.440
In the morning,

24:31.520 --> 24:33.680
you asked Yan to help you
look up tickets to Shanghai.

24:34.240 --> 24:36.600
Now you're putting on makeup

24:37.200 --> 24:38.720
to go on a date with Maidong.

24:38.800 --> 24:40.520
Aren't you being contradictory?

24:41.400 --> 24:43.240
Your grades are so horrible,

24:43.320 --> 24:44.960
but you have time to spy on me.

24:46.200 --> 24:47.840
I've also learned this idiom,

24:47.920 --> 24:49.080
"Flying off the handle."

24:57.880 --> 24:59.280
Jie, you'll find peace in honesty.

24:59.360 --> 25:00.640
It's never too late to change!

25:05.720 --> 25:06.880
Chen Maidong,

25:06.960 --> 25:08.520
I won't break up with you.

25:08.600 --> 25:10.280
I'm going back to Shanghai…

25:10.360 --> 25:11.600
I can't say that.

25:11.680 --> 25:12.840
Chen Maidong, I…

25:13.360 --> 25:16.120
I didn't tell you
because you've been down,

25:16.200 --> 25:17.040
so I didn't dare…

25:17.120 --> 25:18.320
What am I talking about?

25:19.120 --> 25:20.880
Why am I saying this right off the bat?

25:20.960 --> 25:21.960
Chen Maidong,

25:22.040 --> 25:23.480
it's different this time.

25:23.560 --> 25:25.200
It's a different…

25:30.320 --> 25:32.160
How long are you going
to linger down there?

25:32.680 --> 25:33.760
Should I take a nap?

26:29.280 --> 26:30.240
What?

26:31.000 --> 26:32.040
Are we having a meeting?

26:34.280 --> 26:35.360
Let's have a serious chat.

26:49.600 --> 26:50.840
Behave for a while!

26:50.920 --> 26:51.920
Have some self-control.

26:52.880 --> 26:53.840
It's a bit late

26:54.880 --> 26:55.840
to say that.

27:01.560 --> 27:02.400
Here.

27:33.720 --> 27:34.960
What's on your mind?

27:37.560 --> 27:38.520
Nothing.

27:40.400 --> 27:42.680
Then is there anything you want to say?

27:45.080 --> 27:46.360
I don't know where to start.

27:49.160 --> 27:50.080
Chen Maidong,

27:50.760 --> 27:52.880
I can be your best friend.

27:55.600 --> 27:56.600
You already are.

28:03.880 --> 28:05.160
Then tell me

28:06.000 --> 28:07.480
what I can do

28:08.280 --> 28:09.440
to make you feel better.

28:17.360 --> 28:18.280
Actually,

28:19.840 --> 28:21.760
Ms. Lin left the world peacefully.

28:22.320 --> 28:23.320
I also know

28:24.720 --> 28:25.920
that death

28:26.960 --> 28:28.600
might have been a good thing for her.

28:30.640 --> 28:32.120
I comfort others every day,

28:33.680 --> 28:34.960
so I understand that.

28:38.360 --> 28:39.320
To me,

28:41.760 --> 28:43.040
there are two kinds of goodbyes.

28:44.440 --> 28:46.680
Parting in life and parting by death.

28:50.880 --> 28:52.800
The last thing Ms. Lin said to me

28:54.680 --> 28:56.240
was for me to live a good life with you.

28:59.400 --> 29:01.720
And the last thing I said to her was,

29:05.120 --> 29:06.040
"Ms. Lin,

29:08.480 --> 29:09.800
I'm going to tidy up the things.

29:12.320 --> 29:14.200
I'll come back later to listen to you."

29:17.840 --> 29:19.440
But when I turned around,

29:23.800 --> 29:24.760
she was already gone.

29:41.320 --> 29:42.360
I once thought

29:45.080 --> 29:48.160
that the most difficult thing in the world
to get over was death.

29:51.320 --> 29:52.560
So when you told me

29:53.360 --> 29:54.680
I am a noble person,

29:57.440 --> 29:58.400
I neither agreed

30:00.560 --> 30:01.560
nor denied it.

30:04.160 --> 30:05.960
But when a separation
turned into eternal loss

30:07.440 --> 30:09.360
in a matter of minutes,

30:11.720 --> 30:12.880
I suddenly realized

30:15.520 --> 30:16.600
that a parting in life

30:19.720 --> 30:21.200
might be even scarier.

30:35.080 --> 30:36.040
So Zhuang Jie,

30:37.600 --> 30:39.040
I don't want to act tough anymore.

30:40.080 --> 30:40.920
Now,

30:43.160 --> 30:44.800
I don't want you

30:47.560 --> 30:49.240
to disappear from my life in any manner.

30:53.960 --> 30:55.080
Chen Maidong,

30:55.760 --> 30:56.880
me too.

30:58.320 --> 31:02.400
I won't allow you to disappear
from my life in any manner.

31:07.200 --> 31:08.120
Do you know?

31:09.200 --> 31:11.640
When I was in Shanghai,

31:11.720 --> 31:14.440
I met many outstanding men
who were successful in every aspect.

31:14.920 --> 31:18.120
They all knew
how to be flawless in conduct,

31:18.720 --> 31:20.320
how to be gentlemanly, caring,

31:20.400 --> 31:21.880
amusing, and witty.

31:23.840 --> 31:26.480
But I was never attracted to them.

31:27.160 --> 31:29.320
I used to think
there was something wrong with me

31:29.400 --> 31:31.120
because I couldn't find a boyfriend.

31:33.120 --> 31:34.840
It was not until your reappearance

31:35.520 --> 31:36.720
that I realized

31:38.240 --> 31:41.440
I wasn't interested
in the lions and tigers in the zoo.

31:41.920 --> 31:44.960
I only have eyes for a lone wolf like you.

32:04.520 --> 32:07.440
You never need to pretend
to be strong with me.

32:09.080 --> 32:10.200
Although

32:11.240 --> 32:13.320
I have not experienced
as much death as you,

32:14.760 --> 32:17.120
I know how hard it is

32:19.480 --> 32:21.720
to overcome the parting in life
that you described.

32:25.520 --> 32:27.560
You're already doing a great job.

32:29.080 --> 32:31.440
In the future,
you don't have to be so great.

32:33.240 --> 32:34.800
I'll be right by your side.

33:06.280 --> 33:07.120
Get some sleep.

33:31.160 --> 33:32.800
Do you like this lady?

33:37.480 --> 33:38.680
More than that.

33:42.040 --> 33:42.920
I love her.

33:52.160 --> 33:53.280
As long as I think of her,

33:55.280 --> 33:56.760
no matter how difficult things are,

33:58.480 --> 33:59.640
I'll have some hope.

34:03.400 --> 34:04.520
She's pretty lucky.

34:07.320 --> 34:08.400
I'm the lucky one.

34:11.760 --> 34:12.960
What I want to say is,

34:15.080 --> 34:16.360
whether or not you have this leg,

34:17.960 --> 34:19.800
you are the hope
of your family and loved ones.

34:22.159 --> 34:23.480
Don't leave them so easily

34:25.239 --> 34:27.080
or decide for yourself how they feel.

34:29.199 --> 34:30.120
The harder it is,

34:31.000 --> 34:32.000
the more you must try.

34:34.159 --> 34:35.120
Do your best

34:36.840 --> 34:38.920
to live out the rest of your life
with your loved ones.

36:18.160 --> 36:19.000
Grandma?

38:39.320 --> 38:45.320
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
